# Terraform
**/.terraform/*
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
crash.log
crash.*.log
*.tfvars
!*.tfvars.example
*.destroyplan
.cleanup.destroyplan
.build/

# Secrets / local env -- .env.example is the one exception, tracked on purpose.
# Both patterns are needed: `.env.*` does NOT match the bare `.env` filename
# (found by review after the first pass here dropped `.env`).
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key

# OS / editor
.DS_Store
*.swp

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
